  "notes": "USAGE:\nA technical/formal term for sweating. In everyday conversation, {汗|あせ}をかく is far more common. {発汗|はっかん} appears mainly in medical, health, and sports science contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {発汗|はっかん}{作用|さよう}: diaphoretic effect\n- {発汗|はっかん}を{促|うなが}す: to promote sweating\n- {大量|たいりょう}の{発汗|はっかん}: profuse sweating\n- {発汗|はっかん}{量|りょう}: amount of perspiration",
